<section class="tfp-hero">
  <div class="tfp-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="tfp-hero-content reveal-on-scroll">
    <span class="tfp-hero-category">Collaboration</span>
    <h1 class="tfp-hero-title">TfP (Time for Pictures) Shootings</h1>
    <p class="tfp-hero-subtitle">Creating artistic portfolios together through mutual collaboration.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tfp-concept-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="section-category">How It Works</span>
      <h2>The Collaboration Concept</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">TfP stands for "Time for Pictures". It is a partnership between photographer and model where no money is exchanged—we exchange our time and skills to create something beautiful for both our portfolios.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tfp-timeline reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="step-badge">01</div>
        <h3>Before the Shoot</h3>
        <p>We work together to design the session. We agree on the style of photos, coordinate a convenient time and location in the Zurich area, and develop a customized concept and moodboard that excites both of us.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="step-badge">02</div>
        <h3>During the Shoot</h3>
        <p>The shooting takes approximately <strong>2 hours</strong> and is completely free of charge. We'll work collaboratively to bring our agreed moodboard and concept to life in a relaxed, friendly environment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="step-badge">03</div>
        <h3>After the Shoot</h3>
        <p>You will receive a collection of fully retouched, high-resolution digital photos for your personal portfolio and social media. In return, I gain the rights to showcase these photos in my professional portfolio and social channels.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tfp-prep-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="prep-grid">
      <!-- Checklist Card -->
      <div class="prep-card checklist-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <h3>Model Checklist</h3>
        <p class="prep-card-subtitle">How to prepare for our shoot:</p>
        <ul class="styled-checklist">
          <li>
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Wardrobe & Makeup:</strong> Bring clothes and makeup options that align with the moodboard and concept we agreed upon. Multiple outfits are welcome!
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Be on Time:</strong> Please arrive on time so we can make full use of the light and locations. If you run into delays, let me know as early as possible.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Communication:</strong> Share your ideas and references! A great TfP shoot thrives on mutual energy and clear communication.
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contract Card -->
      <div class="prep-card contract-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <h3>Model Release & Contract</h3>
        <p class="prep-card-subtitle">Prepare the paperwork in advance:</p>
        <div class="contract-info">
          <p>A signed Model Release (Vertrag) is required before we begin shooting. This protects both of us and defines the usage rights for our collaborative work.</p>
          <p>You can download, print, and fill out the agreement beforehand to save time on the shoot day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="download-action">
          <a href="/assets/documents/tfp-contract.pdf" download class="btn btn-primary btn-download">
            <span class="btn-icon">⬇</span> Download TFP Contract (PDF)
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Booking CTA -->
    <div class="tfp-cta-container reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2>Let's Create Together</h2>
      <p>Interested in collaborating on a TfP portrait project? Submit a request with your concepts or ideas.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" onclick="localStorage.setItem('prefillPackage', 'Creative: TfP Collaboration')">Submit TfP Collaboration Request</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
